'''Cursed Flaming Party''' is the only stage in '''Peril in the Volcano III''', which appears after clearing [[Infernal Crater Area 16]]. It drops no rewards, but unlocks stages 17–19 of [[Jinfore Volcano]] when cleared. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

