==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ancient Magamojoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Infernal Pegasus Deonil]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As with virtually every other appearance of Magamojoe, you want him down before other significant threats arrive via luring him to the base and whaling on him. [[True Form]]s of [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]], especially [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]] and [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]], help immensely at accomplishing this. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is a must for Wild Doges, J.J. Jackrabbits and Deonil. A [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune attacker]] like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Dragon King Cat]] can help stack DPS. [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] is extremely useful here with her immunity to [[Surge Attack|Surges]], massive damage vs. [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] and high movement speed, speeding up the fight against Magamojoe or outright taking him out, especially if aided by [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]].

You can "stall" at the start for cash by taking out the first SBK, then stopping meatshielding to let the second take out your units. Courier Cat being at Level 50 lets him knockback the Ragin' Gories in 1 hit and Shadow Boxer K in 2, so [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] is not necessary, especially with [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]], but Pizza can still be helpful if the [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] prove to be a problem. The [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]] is recommended to help stop Magamojoe and Deonil so Idi and Courier can get more hits in on their targets.

